The source code of Brickify is public so people can read it, learn from it and see how
the mod is made. Being public does NOT make Brickify open source, and it does NOT give
anyone the right to distribute the mod or its code.

You MAY:

  - read and study the source code
  - build the mod from this source for your own personal use
  - fork this repository on GitHub to suggest changes through issues and pull requests
    (by sending a contribution you agree that it may be used in Brickify under this license)
  - show the mod in videos, streams and screenshots
  - put Brickify in a modpack, but only if the modpack downloads it from an official
    source (the releases page of this repository or the official Brickify pages of
    RustyHS on Modrinth or CurseForge) and does not contain a copy of the jar file

You may NOT, unless RustyHS has given you written permission:

  - upload, mirror or redistribute Brickify, its jar files or this source code, original
    or changed, on any website, mod platform, launcher, store or file host
  - release a changed version, a port or a fork of Brickify, or a mod that is mostly
    based on its code
  - sell Brickify or use it commercially (videos and streams are fine)
  - remove or change this license or the credits

